# Docker build context (rm-152): allowlist — only what the Dockerfile COPYs
# from the context ever enters the daemon. The tree (394MB node_modules, .git,
# engine state, docs, tests) shrank local context from ~358MB to ~3MB.
#
# COPY set (Dockerfile:9,15,29,46,49,50,53): package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml,
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, src/, public/, web/ — keep this list in sync with any
# new COPY. Later rules override earlier ones, so the web/dist and
# web/node_modules re-ignores must stay AFTER the !web re-includes: the builder
# rebuilds web/dist itself and must not bake a stale local one.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!src
!src/**
!public
!public/**
!web
!web/**
web/dist
web/node_modules
